{"id":"3655651094201b66","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-illfounded-tree.md","title":"ZFC Illfounded Tree","display":"df-zfc-illfounded-tree — ZFC Illfounded Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-illfounded-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-illfounded-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-illfounded-tree — ZFC Illfounded Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-illfounded-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-illfounded-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-illfounded-tree — ZFC Illfounded Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (tree candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IllfoundedTree}\">\\(\\operatorname{IllfoundedTree}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\">\\(A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\\)</span>；有限序列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}(s)=|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}(s)=|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}illfounded\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\operatorname{IllfoundedTree}(T,X)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\bigl(\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\to (s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\land\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}illfounded\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\operatorname{IllfoundedTree}(T,X)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\bigl(\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\to (s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\land\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The prefix-closure conjunct ensures that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is actually a tree of finite sequences; the final conjunct supplies an infinite branch.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq X^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IllfoundedTree}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}(s)=|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}illfounded\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\operatorname{IllfoundedTree}(T,X)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq X^{<\\omega}\\land\\bigl(\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\to (s{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\land\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f{\\upharpoonright}n\\in T)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1174,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-illfounded-tree.md|58-df-zfc-illfounded-tree]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["f4bf86f66c1444da","36d7463d215be751"]}